ue},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"directly only when you need lower-level access — raw "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"makeCredential"},{"type":"text","text":" \/"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"getAssertion"},{"type":"text","text":", credential management, or bio enrollment."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Client"},{"type":"text","text":" is an actor; a client’s lifetime is bound to the underlying "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/Session","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The constructor takes four parameters that shape every ceremony:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origin"},{"type":"text","text":" — the secure origin the client is bound to. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Origin","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" enforces"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the W3C secure-context rule; the client refuses to sign for relying parties whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier doesn’t match."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isPublicSuffix"},{"type":"text","text":" — a closure into a Public Suffix List, used to validate that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the relying-party identifier is a registrable suffix of the origin’s effective"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"domain."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enterpriseRpIds"},{"type":"text","text":" — relying-party identifiers allowed to receive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform-managed enterprise attestation. When the request specifies"},{"type":"text","text":" 